# TMDB credentials, read at build time by Vite.
# Use a free TMDB API key (v3, sent as the api_key query parameter).
# A v4 API Read Access Token (starts with "eyJ") also works: it is sent as an
# "Authorization: Bearer" header instead.
# Get one at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=
